add('def-qc-unitary-conjugation-channel','definition','QC05','For a unitary U:H→K between nonzero finite spaces of equal dimension, define Ad_U(X)=UXU†. Its input/output matrix spaces and scalar representative are explicit; channel validity is a separate proposition.',['def-qc-quantum-channel','def-linear-isometry-and-orthogonal-or-unitary-operator'],['Specify exact unitary and adjoint domains. Global scalar invariance is a separately proved statement, especially when later control is present.'])
